    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d475-a8">

                <pb facs="0491" n="1225" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1225"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure 2 to inclosure
                    3.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Estanislao de Antonio to Mr. Williams.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >General Government of the Island of Cuba,<lb/>Office of the
                                Secretary</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Havana</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1895-03-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March 27, 1895</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The governor of the province of Havana
                    reports on the 24th instant to this Government General as follows:</p>
                <p>“<hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: In compliance with your order of
                    the 20th instant., I have the honor to inform your excellency that Mr. Francisco
                    Carrillo does not appear as inscribed in the register of foreigners kept in this
                    office.”</p>
                <p>I have to communicate the above to you by order of his excellency, to the end
                    that you may present evidence of Mr. Carrillo having complied with the
                    prescriptions of article 7 of the law of the 4th of July, 1870, with reference
                    to his inscriptions as a foreigner in the register of foreigners of some other
                    civil government of this island, or that you please say in what provincial
                    government you know or suppose the said-inscription was made, so that I may
                    request the necessary certificate.</p>
                <p>God guard you many years.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Estanislao de Antonio.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
